---
description: Require braces on all if/else/for/while statements
globs: **/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Curly braces

Always use braces for `if`, `else`, `for`, `while`, and `do`. Never write a single-statement body on the same line.

```ts
// BAD
if (status === 'running') return null

// GOOD
if (status === 'running') {
  return null
}
```
